{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地女星孟子義與李昀銳合作無間，三度合作的劇集《尚公主》即將開播，兩人最近為宣傳劇集密密同框，日前孟子義錄製綜藝節目，李昀銳更驚喜現身探班，到錄製現場接放工，甚至餵飲水、撐傘等，惟此舉引起網民議論，指男方過於依賴孟子義光環。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T18:19:35.723524+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:37:43.636434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T18:17:45.918188+00:00","content_hash":"b00efba550d0c1697fdb8e2f1cfb728a6dac500ee46ee43dca324ac1c3fc2323","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}